          "data": {
            "variant": "info",
            "title": "",
            "content": "Cada Task state suporta Retry (com backoff exponencial, max attempts) e Catch (redirecionar pra state de error handling). Essencial pra workflows production: DB falhou? Retry 3x com 5/25/125s. Still fail? Vai pra fallback state que notifica Slack."
          }
        }
